  "why_not_llm_soft_ranking": "LLM soft-ranking remains production-aligned sample limited, and recent non-OHLCV audits found no usable PIT short/option/Form4 or SEC/earnings evidence for another replay. This tests a deterministic production-visible allocation alpha instead.",
  "mechanism_insight_check": {
    "near_repeat": "qualified_orthogonal_retry_after_exp-20260503-046",
    "notes": "This is not another raw pct-margin threshold. The denominator is ticker ATR% at signal time, so it asks whether leadership is large relative to the name's own volatility. It does not retry leader multipliers, caps, add-on caps, target floors, global ranking, or static universe expansion."
  },
